      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Mix a Hitchcock masterpiece with a juicy spy novel, add a dash of Monty Python and you have The 39 Steps, a fast-paced whodunit for anyone who loves the magic of theatre! This Broadway and West End long-running hit is packed with nonstop laughs, over 150 zany characters (played by a ridiculously tal"
