      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "3x Juno Awards R&amp;B/Soul Recording of the Year nominee and 3x Polaris Music Prize long-list nominee Tanika Charles is synonymous with Canadian Soul music. Her music revels in honesty and attitude, her live show is high energy and endearing, and she continues to organically win audiences over"
      }
