        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "With their signature blend of Jamaican rhythms, bluesy tones, and heavy rock, they’ve been a fixture on the airwaves and concert circuit since the 1990s. Join us as Big Sugar celebrates its “Five Hundred Pounds” deluxe vinyl with a theatrical presentation spanning its 25-year career."
