      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Gilson Lubin is a former MTV Canada host and Canadian Comedy Award winner as a stand-up comedian. His comedy album “Foreign and Legal” airs on Sirius XM and he has appeared on Comedy Central’s Premium Blend, HBO’s Def Jam Comedy series, Kevin Hart's LOL Network, and Comedy Now CTV."
