        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "JUNO Award-winning ElliottBROOD is a three-piece Folk Rock Alt Country band based in Hamilton, Ontario. Their style has been called everything from ‘blackgrass’ to ‘death country,’ but those descriptions don’t capture the transcendent heights of their unique approach to roots music."
