        "@value": "Ms Measha Brueggergosman-Lee performs a night of modern music and jazz at The Grove Theatre. From art song to jazz to opera, this Grammy Award nominee has appeared from Carnegie Hall and Washington’s Kennedy Center to London’s Wigmore Hall and the Musikverein in Vienna.   Sponsored by David Ahrens,"
