        "@value": "Carl Dixon's solo show is a rock ride with music and stories from his days opening for Iron Maiden and Judas Priest to fronting The Guess Who. Carl has an extensive repertoire of songs from his solo records, band Coney Hatch and from touring in April Wine. His voice has been described on CBC radio a"
