        "@value": "Fun and silly for the whole family, The Comedy Of Errors is one of the great slapstick comedies. It will have you laughing out loud. In the same style as last year’s The 39 Steps, The Grove Theatre presents this classic comedy.   July 20, 22, 25 (Preview), 27 (Opening), 29 August 2, 6, 8, 10, 15, 17"
