      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "An afternoon of incredible circus acts, while celebrating African culture and dance. Featuring Abebe and Rabin, you'll be treated to incredible balancing acts, mesmerizing juggling displays, and impossible acrobatic feats. Fun for the entire family!"
      }
