    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Playing alternating nights.    Written by William Shakespeare.  Fun and silly for the whole family,  The Comedy Of Errors  is one of the great slapstick comedies. It will have you laughing out loud. In the same style as last year’s  The 39 Steps , The Grove Theatre presents this classic comedy."
