      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Local favourite Madison Kozak, now based in Nashville, brings her compelling voice and country music to The Grove along with guests Griffen Palmer and more. Enjoy an evening of stories and music under the stars with these incredible up-and-coming country musicians."
      }
